-\url{https://github.com/GBeurier/nirs4all} and the documentation at
-\url{https://nirs4all.readthedocs.io}.  The desktop application is available
-at \url{https://github.com/GBeurier/nirs4all-webapp}.  Benchmark code and
-result tables supporting the claims in this paper will be made available
-upon publication.
+The public software entry point is \texttt{nirs4all} at
+\url{https://github.com/GBeurier/nirs4all}, with documentation at
+\url{https://nirs4all.readthedocs.io}.  The experiment code for this paper
+will be released upon publication at \url{https://github.com/gbeurier/aom}.
+A portable PLS / NIRS engine with stable C ABI and first-class bindings for
+Python, R, MATLAB, JavaScript/WebAssembly and Android will be released at
+\url{https://github.com/gbeurier/pls4all}.
 
