-This work makes four contributions.  First, it formalizes
-operator-adaptive calibration for NIRS.  Second, it gives PLS and Ridge
-instantiations that retain original-space coefficients.  Third, it introduces
-FastAOM, a low-rank screening framework for exploring chains and
-operator-induced kernels without fitting every candidate pipeline naively.
-Fourth, it compares the resulting models with standard PLS/Ridge and with a
