-\section{Seed Stability}
+The failure ledger separates denominator pathology, estimator input failure
+and ordinary model mismatch.  QUARTZ is a denominator case: absolute errors
+remain meaningful, but ratios are excluded because the reference denominator
+is near zero.  The two FUSARIUM response rows listed in the review artifacts
+contain NaN values for the HPO estimators.  Other large spreads correspond to
+ordinary dataset/model mismatch rather than failed execution.
 
