-This work was prepared within CIRAD and UMR AGAP Institut.  The authors thank
-the developers and users of the \texttt{nirs4all} ecosystem and the teams who
-released public NIRS datasets enabling multi-dataset chemometric benchmarking.
+The supplementary material contains complete derivations, the cohort
+manifest, operator-bank diagnostics, non-selected AOM variants, alternative
+AOM-form explorations, per-dataset tables, classification details, failure
