+The simulation check for this identity is direct: explicit transformed-space
+PLS and covariance-space AOM-PLS must select the same operator direction when
+the same centered fold and operator bank are supplied.  The check is used as
+an implementation guard, while the benchmark below evaluates the effect on
+held-out prediction.
+
+\subsection{AOM-PLS solvers and coefficient recovery}
+
+A standard PLS coefficient matrix can be written as
 \begin{equation}
-  z_a = \A_b\transpose r_a .
+  \B=\mathbf W(\mathbf P^\transpose\mathbf W)^+\mathbf Q^\transpose ,
