-2024.55 s.  By contrast, ASLS-AOM-compact-cv5 has a median fit time of 1.89 s
-in the multi-seed run, FastAOM-sparse-mkr-compact 2.48 s, and
-FastAOM-single-chain-compact 1.86 s.  AOMRidge-Blender is heavier
-(median 960.08 s) but remains competitive with Ridge-HPO while retaining a
