+before strict-linear AOM selection.  The default bank, SIMPLS-only variants,
+and other non-selected AOM variants are reported in the supplementary
+material.
+
+The compact bank was chosen from the selector diagnostics, not by adding an
+unbounded operator catalogue.  In the refreshed diagnostics, the three most
+frequent strict operators
 (\texttt{sg\_smooth\_w21\_p3}, \texttt{sg\_d1\_w21\_p3} and
